#: src/frontier_util.c:104
msgid "Okay, I understand…"
msgstr "好的，我明白了……"

#: src/frontier_util.c:105
msgid "Thank you…"
msgstr "谢谢你……"

#: src/frontier_util.c:108
msgid "It's very disappointing…"
msgstr "真是太遗憾了……"

#: src/frontier_util.c:109
msgid "I'm terribly sorry…"
msgstr "非常抱歉……"

#: src/frontier_util.c:122
msgid ""
"Grr…\n"
"What the…"
msgstr ""
"呜……\n"
"怎么会……"

#: src/frontier_util.c:125
msgid ""
"Ahahaha!\n"
"You're inspiring!"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈哈！\n"
"你真让人热血沸腾！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:130
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! Aren't you embarrassed?\n"
"Everyone's watching!"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈哈！你不觉得丢脸吗？\n"
"大家都在看着呢！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:133
msgid "My DOME ACE title isn't just for show!"
msgstr "我巨蛋王牌的称号可不是虚名！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:146
msgid ""
"Ah…\n"
"Now this is something else…"
msgstr ""
"啊……\n"
"这可真是了不起……"

#: src/frontier_util.c:149
msgid ""
"Gwah!\n"
"Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""
"咕哇！\n"
"哈哈哈哈！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:154
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON are wimpy because\n"
"you're wimpy as a TRAINER!"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦这么弱，\n"
"是因为你这个训练家太弱了！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:157
msgid ""
"Gwahahaha!\n"
"My brethren, we have nothing to fear!"
msgstr ""
"咕哇哈哈哈！\n"
"我的同伴们，我们无所畏惧！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:172
msgid ""
"No way!\n"
"Good job!"
msgstr ""
"不会吧！\n"
"干得好！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:175
msgid ""
"Huh?\n"
"Are you serious?!"
msgstr ""
"咦？\n"
"你是认真的吗？！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:180
msgid ""
"Oh, come on!\n"
"You have to try harder than that!"
msgstr ""
"喂喂，拜托！\n"
"你得再加把劲才行啊！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:183
msgid ""
"Heheh!\n"
"What did you expect?"
msgstr ""
"嘿嘿！\n"
"你以为会怎样？"

#: src/frontier_util.c:198
msgid ""
"Good job!\n"
"You know what you're doing!"
msgstr ""
"干得好！\n"
"你很懂行嘛！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:201
msgid "What happened here?"
msgstr "这是怎么回事？"

#: src/frontier_util.c:204
msgid ""
"Way to work!\n"
"That was a good lesson, eh?"
msgstr ""
"辛苦啦！\n"
"这是很好的一课吧？"

#: src/frontier_util.c:207
msgid ""
"Hey, hey, hey!\n"
"You're finished already?"
msgstr ""
"喂喂喂！\n"
"你这就不行了？"

#: src/frontier_util.c:222
msgid "Urk…"
msgstr "呜……"

#: src/frontier_util.c:223
msgid "Darn!"
msgstr "可恶！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:226
msgid "Humph…"
msgstr "哼……"

#: src/frontier_util.c:227
msgid "Hah!"
msgstr "哈！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:240
msgid ""
"That's it! You've done great!\n"
"You've worked hard for this!"
msgstr ""
"就是这样！你干得太棒了！\n"
"这是你努力的成果！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:243
msgid ""
"That's it! You've done it!\n"
"You kept working for this!"
msgstr ""
"就是这样！你做到了！\n"
"这是你坚持不懈的成果！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:248
msgid ""
"Hey! What's wrong with you!\n"
"Let's see some effort! Get up!"
msgstr ""
"喂！你怎么回事！\n"
"拿出点干劲来！站起来！"

#: src/frontier_util.c:251
msgid ""
"Hey! Don't you give up now!\n"
"Get up! Don't lose faith in yourself!"
msgstr ""
"喂！现在可不许放弃！\n"
"站起来！别对自己失去信心！"
